<report>
<title>Odds ratio meta-analysis</title>

  <table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th colspan="5">Table (exposed +ve, control +ve, exposed -ve, control -ve)</th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@a</td><td>@b</td><td>@c</td><td>@d</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Odds ratio</th><th colspan="3"><ci>@pc% CI (@method)</ci></th></tr>
<block name="or"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{or:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{uci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@lb</ci></td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th colspan="3">% Weights (fixed, random)</th></tr>
<block name="or"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{yi:roundu}</td><td>@{vi:roundu}</td><td>@{wt:roundu}</td><td>@{dwt:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Fixed effects (Mantel-Haenszel, @meth)</u><br />
Pooled odds ratio = @{odds:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Chi<sub>2</sub> (test odds ratio differs from 1) = @{chi_mantel:roundu}  <pval>@{chi_p:pval}</pval></p>

<block name="cml">
<p><u>Fixed effects (conditional maximum likelihood)</u><br />
Pooled odds ratio = @{eor:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact Fisher @pc% CI = @{llf:roundu} to @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P @pc% CI = @{llm:roundu} to @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>

</block>
<p><u>Non-combinability of studies</u><br />
Breslow-Day = @{bd:roundu}  (df = @df)  <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval><br />
Cochran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df_cochran)  <pval>@{xp_cochran:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @isq% (<ci>@pc1% CI = @llisq% to @ulisq%</ci>) </p>

<p><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u><br />
Pooled odds ratio = @{dsor:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{dsll:roundu} to @{dsul:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Chi<sub>2</sub> (test odds ratio differs from 1) = @{dsx2:roundu}  (df = @df_ds)  <pval>@{xp_ds:pval}</pval></p>

<block name="egger">
<p><u>Bias indicators</u><br />
Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @tau  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_egger% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
<block name="harbord">
<p>Harbord-Egger: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_harbord% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
